    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: The game lasts for a total of 15 rounds. Before the game starts, you have
    3 Points. After you distribute them, click Start to begin the game. The game
    enters breaktime every five rounds. You can only distribute weapons during the
    break, which means you can only watch the competition during non-break time.
    Each time you enter a break, you will receive two additional Points. When you're
    ready to continue, click Start to resume the game.
